      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "South Coast Solar Solutions provided great customer service, they made the effort to call to discuss and they did not try to hard sell their product, they gave me options on three systems and different sizes and didn't push me at all.  Unlike the other two options, all I got was an email from one of the options which didn't answer half my questions and the third option who didn't even bother to contact me at all.South Coast Solar Solutions made the effort to answer every question, they provided a quote with no hidden costs, the installation happened with ease, the employees were polite and well mannered and they did a follow up call and visit to be sure we understood the system and how to read all the displays.Of the other two options, one sent an email that didn't tell me much beyond the price and a second email included a $300-$500 additional fee for travel because I wasn't local.  The third option who I had expected to provide excellent service based on their reviews, didn't even contact me.  So while it wasn't hard to see why I went with South Coast Solar Solutions, the quality of service and installation was excellent.  I would use them again.",
